From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 14:15:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] avcodec/hevc: decode the slices set aside with the POC of
 their picture

ffmpeg-9974 decodes the slices it set aside once every layer's picture
has started, and each picture's start sets s->poc (hevc_frame_start()):
the base layer's slices were decoded with the POC of the second layer's
picture, and mvs.c scales motion vectors by s->poc. Keep the POC of each
layer's picture with the rest of its state and put it back before its
slices are decoded, as the slice data is decoded without ffmpeg-9974.

In a conforming stream every picture of an access unit has the same POC,
so its pictures do not change; a stream whose layers disagree decodes as
it does without ffmpeg-9974.

As in cinemaONE's port of ffmpeg-9974 to FFmpeg master (pull request
26397 on code.ffmpeg.org), which also keeps first_nal_type: in FFmpeg
9.1 that is read only in decode_slice(), before a slice is set aside.
---
 libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c | 4 ++++
 libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.h | 1 +
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c b/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c
index f705519..4effbb3 100644
--- a/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c
+++ b/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.c
@@ -3710,6 +3710,7 @@ static int hevc_frame_start(HEVCContext *s, HEVCLayerContext *l,
         HEVCDeferredLayer *dl = &s->deferred_layers[l - s->layers];
         memcpy(dl->rps, s->rps, sizeof(dl->rps));
         av_refstruct_replace(&dl->pps, s->pps);
+        dl->poc = s->poc;
     }
 
     if (nal_idx >= s->finish_setup_nal_idx)
@@ -3917,6 +3918,9 @@ static int decode_deferred_slices(HEVCContext *s)
         s->nuh_layer_id = d->nuh_layer_id;
         av_refstruct_replace(&s->pps, dl->pps);
         memcpy(s->rps, dl->rps, sizeof(s->rps));
+        // (the next layer's picture, started since, set s->poc: motion vectors
+        // are scaled by the POC of the picture they belong to, mvs.c)
+        s->poc = dl->poc;
         if (s->sh.first_slice_in_pic_flag) {
             s->slice_idx = 0;
             if (s->pps->tiles_enabled_flag)
diff --git a/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.h b/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.h
index 293d34f..30919fc 100644
--- a/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.h
+++ b/libavcodec/hevc/hevcdec.h
@@ -516,6 +516,7 @@ typedef struct HEVCDeferredSlice {
 typedef struct HEVCDeferredLayer {
     RefPicList rps[NB_RPS_TYPE];
     const HEVCPPS *pps; ///< RefStruct reference
+    int poc;            ///< the POC of the layer's picture (s->poc when it started)
 } HEVCDeferredLayer;
 
 typedef struct HEVCContext {
